  <channel>
    <title>Nublet</title>
    <description>Updates for Nublet — your whole toolkit, in the notch.</description>
    <language>en</language>

    <!--
      One <item> per release, NEWEST FIRST. Don't hand-write these: `Scripts/package.sh` builds and
      notarizes the DMG and prints a complete <item> with the real length and edSignature — paste
      that, then upload the DMG as the release asset.

      TWO THINGS THAT MUST BE RIGHT, because both fail silently:

      * `sparkle:version` is compared against the app's CFBundleVersion — the BUILD NUMBER, not the
        marketing version. If it reads "0.19.0" while the app reports "264", Sparkle is comparing a
        string to an integer and the update is simply never offered.
      * `length` must be the DMG's exact byte count and `edSignature` its real signature. This file
        shipped for weeks with `length="12345678"` and
        `edSignature="BASE64_SIGNATURE_FROM_package.sh"` — the literal placeholders — which means
        auto-update has never worked for anyone.
    -->

    <item>
      <title>0.19.0</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 21:29:35 +0700</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>264</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.19.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.6</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li><b>Walk into a stashed folder</b> — drill in, browse, come back. Multi-select and drag several files out at once.</li>
          <li><b>The shelf groups by drop</b> and holds 100 files by default, up from 24.</li>
          <li><b>Edit a calendar event inside the notch</b>, with its own month picker instead of a system dialog.</li>
          <li>Capture and Dictate moved to the Home page; the tab strip is quieter.</li>
          <li><b>Fixed:</b> a crash when changing the app's text size — it affected ten windows, not one.</li>
          <li><b>Fixed:</b> dragging a file out could arrive as a 0&nbsp;KB attachment.</li>
          <li><b>Fixed:</b> the page icon vanished mid-swipe and the notch height wobbled with it.</li>
          <li><b>Fixed:</b> the star and delete buttons never appeared on a clipboard card.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
      <enclosure
        url="https://github.com/abdullahdevrangga11/nublet-releases/releases/download/v0.19.0/Nublet-0.19.0.dmg"
